{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of &quot;Tiny Crate&quot;! This is a 2D pixel-style game that combines platform jumping and puzzle-solving elements. Players will take on the role of a brave little creature, exploring levels filled with challenges and secrets. In the game, you'll need to use jumping and puzzle-solving skills to overcome various obstacles, unlock new areas, and uncover hidden stories.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Pixel Art Style:</strong> Featuring retro pixel art, delivering a nostalgic visual experience.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Level Design:</strong> Each level has unique layouts and challenges, testing players' reflexes and intelligence.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Original Soundtrack:</strong> Original music and sound effects enhance the immersive gaming experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614490?t=1742951756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614490?t=1742951756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614490/feca67b5837f73390a1c08f1e54dadaea1965824/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742951756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614490/feca67b5837f73390a1c08f1e54dadaea1965824/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742951756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of &quot;Tiny Crate&quot;! This is a 2D pixel-style game that combines platform jumping and puzzle-solving elements. Players will take on the role of a brave little creature, exploring levels filled with challenges and se